{"id":"n58297-2-9","stage":1,"title":"직장 · 职业","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58297-2-9-1","ko":"넌 언제까지 집에서 놀고만 있을래?","zh":"你打算在家里闲着到什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제까지","audio":"/audio/8902d9621c6f3af4db86.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"놀고만","meaning":"赋闲，赋闲在家，失业","explanation":"놀다：赋闲，赋闲在家，失业；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"2","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀고만","audio":"/audio/5eb72a3dc249372e2ee4.mp3"}},{"text":"있을래?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을래","audio":"/audio/7df651bd7b445cea88ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"赋闲，赋闲在家，失业","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"没有职业或无所事事地度日。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad5a90f0bc2fca3f56d9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58297-2-9-2","ko":"직장이 안 구해지는 걸 어떻게 하라고요.","zh":"工作都找不到的话，我还能怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"직장이","meaning":"职业，职场，工作","explanation":"직장：职业，职场，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"2","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장이","audio":"/audio/b046d93de3c8101820d8.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"구해지는","meaning":"寻找、找到（这里指找工作）；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"구하다：寻找、找到（这里指找工作）；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구해지는","audio":"/audio/fc23673755e2000748b2.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"하라고요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；라고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하라고요","audio":"/audio/22ae46339ee46e9de62b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"职业，职场，工作","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而做的事。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"288eb4bbfc0c27cc","term":"구하다","zh":"寻找、找到（这里指找工作）","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3","entryId":"58299","definition":"寻找、找到（这里指找工作）","pronunciation":["구하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronu